{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_06_beg","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_06","title":"邂逅","storyCode":"RI-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c80b0473d8f746ed57d1d08a0b579e1fec45e8d70f6ed40937c71cbd012865c9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，狀態怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我不得不說，開炮的聲音嚇到我了，我在開炮的時候差點就飛出去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是大醜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是順便提一下我的狀況。大醜和預想的一樣，連續開炮會導致過熱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"但是效果很好，嗯，我不得不說，效果非常好！雖然我確實被嚇到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"總之回到部族之後，還要好好修一修！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這次的祭典太急了，大醜還沒有準備好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我想等大醜準備好再和其他部族商量重新舉辦祭典的，結果現在就舉行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，結果好就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得那些小傢伙們看到大醜時臉上吃驚的表情！哈哈，太有趣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，目的已經達到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，這裡將迎來新的秩序，新的時代！噢，機械時代！聽起來太棒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得叫“大醜時代”怎麼樣？哦，我覺得“大祭司時代”也不錯，聽起來和我一樣酷炫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"就叫機械時代就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你這孩子什麼都好，就是太古板了，既然學習了外面的知識，就應該看到更多的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"你看我，這一身打扮，不覺得很潮流，很有知性嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"太矮了根本就看不到，不過潮流是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，算了，對不起，我不該和你聊這個話題，但是沒關係，我會親自為你挑選一套適合大酋長身份的衣服的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服隨便，比起這個，留在部族的人剛才傳來消息，他們搶到了一個引擎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好像是從嘉維爾回來的載具上搶來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我迫不及待地想要看到它了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這麼一說，我直接去看看不就好了，那我先走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司還是老樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，族長身邊那隻黎博利是誰啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你是新來的吧？那是大祭司大人！開大醜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，我也想開大醜啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，你是不知道，以前大醜還沒完成的時候，天天爆炸，弄傷了好幾個弟兄，到後來誰都不敢坐上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"然後大祭司大人就來了，別小看他，他每次被炸飛出去都能活著回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？這麼厲害？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，雖然不知道他以前是哪個部族的，但是我們現在都叫他大祭司大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那邊的不是尤吉嗎？喂，尤吉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是和你哥哥在一起嗎？你哥哥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我正要為這個去找族長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢貨，現在要叫大酋長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我正要為這個去找大酋長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大酋長，我哥哥得了石頭病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"說薩爾貢語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是，對不起，我還不怎麼熟練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......他怎麼得的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥之前為了採到更多的礦，不顧我的反對一個人去了裡面的礦區......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"那個蠢貨，我不是說過絕對不能深入礦區的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在被嘉維爾帶走治療了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嘉維爾好像真的成了醫生，本來哥哥很難受的樣子，她三兩下就讓哥哥看起來好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來成為醫生不是謊話嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾還讓我給你帶話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"她說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"她說她有事來找你，她好像很生氣的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，肯定是被族長打敗不服氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，族長那一下，轟！實在是太厲害了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了叫大酋長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你也忘了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"煩死人了，混帳，族長就是族長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你才煩死人了！我就是改不過口來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道嘉維爾不是那種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大酋長，我相信嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也相信她，你的哥哥不會有事的。他在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"在特米米的部族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米......之後你再去接你哥哥吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜嘉維爾肯定是來要回她的引擎的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......除非她能贏過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認，嘉維爾很強，但她認為自己的拳頭就是一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她來要回引擎，那就再讓她嘗嘗大醜的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我不會把引擎還給她的，這台引擎對我們部族，不，對我們的未來也很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，你是不是提到了嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"燧石，你聽到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"回家裡的床上喊你的大酋長吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是，讓你阿母教你大酋長怎麼喊吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你們太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你......克瑪爾？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想讓她來，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"她來，我會打敗她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是不想。讓我去阻止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，在哪兒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，這個雨林好潮濕啊，才走半天背上就都是汗了，而且我都走了兩天了也沒見到一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我早就把泳裝穿在裡面了，這下倒是正好，直接用上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，爬上樹看到的也只有樹，嘉維爾說的祭典到底在哪兒啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，有人嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，嘉維爾，你的尾巴好細啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你的兜帽是不是該換換了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，果然博士他們不在附近啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是博士有什麼閃失，我可怎麼向阿米婭交代啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然嘉維爾說看著博士應該可以放心......不對，以那傢伙的性格，我真的可以放心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，越想越擔心，要不然砍幾棵樹製造點噪音試試？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......按照尤吉的說法，嘉維爾應該在這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，我終於見到人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，你好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見過的穿著，你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你說啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不懂我說的話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，不會吧，嘉維爾那傢伙可沒說過語言不通的事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，看上去很強的樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這就是這裡人的待客之道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是個強者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"在打敗嘉維爾之前，先和你戰一場吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這傢伙的發音好像提到了嘉維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我正心情不好呢，既然你要打，那我奉陪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["燧石"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
